OL,3,GNEWSACrowd gathers after cricket team
OL,4,Amistaken for migrants
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn international cricket team became
OL,7,Fthe mistaken focus of an anti-migrant
OL,8,Fprotest after being spotted entering a
OL,9,Fhotel in Portsmouth.
OL,11,FReform county councillor George
OL,12,FMadgwick said about 30 to 40 people
OL,13,Fgathered outside the Marriott Hotel in
OL,14,FCosham on Tuesday evening, amid false
OL,15,Frumours that a group of migrants had
OL,16,Farrived by bus.
OL,18,FIn a now-deleted Facebook post, he
OL,19,Furged people not to attend, saying
OL,20,Fhotel staff showed him "proof" the
OL,21,Fguests were the touring Pakistan
OL,22,Funder-19 national cricket team.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
